+/*
+ * oFono - Open Source Telephony
+ *
+ * The atoms that keep D-Bus requests instead of answering InProgress:
+ * org.ofono.NetworkRegistration, RadioSettings, MessageManager and
+ * CallForwarding. A second client must get an answer, not an error, and no
+ * request may stay unanswered or be answered twice, also when the atom goes
+ * away with requests waiting.
+ *
+ * The real atoms, the D-Bus helpers and the queue are built into this test,
+ * on a small model of src/modem.c, with scripted drivers that finish each
+ * operation when the test says so. Clients are a second connection to the
+ * bus: run it under dbus-run-session. Without a bus the test reports itself
+ * skipped.
+ *
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
+ */
